(4208948, 606552, 66952, '<td valign="top">The lighting and detail are nice. Overall, a good entry. Some nitpicks...Maybe it''s the crop, maybe it''s the border, but it''s hard to get a sense of perspective, and to know when the house ends and the border begins. It also may be the crop, but the house looks too nice to be abandoned.</td>', 'The lighting and detail are nice. Overall, a good entry. Some nitpicks...Maybe it''s the crop, maybe it''s the border, but it''s hard to get a sense of perspective, and to know when the house ends and the border begins. It also may be the crop, but the house looks too nice to be abandoned.', '2007-10-31 16:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4208953, 606702, 66952, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait, it would be better without the coffee, but otherwise, nicely lit and framed, and it has a nice, casual feel. The leather jacket might be a touch too sharp, my eye keeps getting drawn to the grain in the leather, but that''s a nitpick on an image that''s very nice overall.</td>', 'Lovely portrait, it would be better without the coffee, but otherwise, nicely lit and framed, and it has a nice, casual feel. The leather jacket might be a touch too sharp, my eye keeps getting drawn to the grain in the leather, but that''s a nitpick on an image that''s very nice overall.', '2007-10-31 16:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4208956, 606722, 66952, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. It has a feel of a summer gone by and forgotten in a swirl of leaves.</td>', 'Nicely done. It has a feel of a summer gone by and forgotten in a swirl of leaves.', '2007-10-31 16:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
