(4209664, 606701, 75386, '<td valign="top">meets challenge well, but the framing could be better imo. dunno if it was possible, but eliminating the background (maybe with shallow dof) and getting rid of the foreground would have made this 200% betetr.<br/>I do like the subject a lot though</td>', 'meets challenge well, but the framing could be better imo. dunno if it was possible, but eliminating the background (maybe with shallow dof) and getting rid of the foreground would have made this 200% betetr.I do like the subject a lot though', '2007-10-31 20:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4209666, 606819, 85383, '<td valign="top">underexposed</td>', 'underexposed', '2007-10-31 20:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4209667, 606123, 75386, '<td valign="top">hmm if 1998 is old...<br/>the bike is blurry and youll prob pay for that.  I really like the foreground blur and the shadow of the bike though</td>', 'hmm if 1998 is old...the bike is blurry and youll prob pay for that.  I really like the foreground blur and the shadow of the bike though', '2007-10-31 20:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
