(4209674, 606589, 75386, '<td valign="top">nice exposure. i like the colors a lot.  is it a bit crooked? could be me, so im not considering that in my vote</td>', 'nice exposure. i like the colors a lot.  is it a bit crooked? could be me, so im not considering that in my vote', '2007-10-31 20:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
