(4211296, 606703, 10665, '<td valign="top">Have you been playing in my basement?  Has the feel of a textbook photo from the 60''s.  The lines in the shot all seem to be skued, the power bar, the bricks and the frame on the enlarger.  At least one should be level.</td>', 'Have you been playing in my basement?  Has the feel of a textbook photo from the 60''s.  The lines in the shot all seem to be skued, the power bar, the bricks and the frame on the enlarger.  At least one should be level.', '2007-11-01 07:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
