(4211317, 606722, 10665, '<td valign="top">Nice framing, I might have liked a bit stronger focus on the bottom edge of the frame.  I would have also either skipped the frame completely or not gone with white, as it is too crisp vs the subject.</td>', 'Nice framing, I might have liked a bit stronger focus on the bottom edge of the frame.  I would have also either skipped the frame completely or not gone with white, as it is too crisp vs the subject.', '2007-11-01 07:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
