(4211553, 605439, 65234, '<td valign="top">Good choice of subject(s).  DOF and lighting are good.  Composition is a bit staid but I guess that''s appropriate for the time period (though not necessarily for Frank himself).</td>', 'Good choice of subject(s).  DOF and lighting are good.  Composition is a bit staid but I guess that''s appropriate for the time period (though not necessarily for Frank himself).', '2007-11-01 09:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
