(4211560, 606154, 65234, '<td valign="top">Good choice of subject, composition, colors.  Makes me want to know more about her ... she seems wearily happy, and not convinced that happiness will last more than a fleeting moment.</td>', 'Good choice of subject, composition, colors.  Makes me want to know more about her ... she seems wearily happy, and not convinced that happiness will last more than a fleeting moment.', '2007-11-01 09:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
