(4211671, 604893, 65234, '<td valign="top">An old car in an old barn!  Nice find.  I would prefer less of a straight-on composition to add interest, but I don''t know what else was in the area that could''ve detracted from the subject if you changed position.</td>', 'An old car in an old barn!  Nice find.  I would prefer less of a straight-on composition to add interest, but I don''t know what else was in the area that could''ve detracted from the subject if you changed position.', '2007-11-01 09:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
