(4211761, 606392, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait.  Only nit is that the bit of pink in the background keeps drawing my eye.  I might have tried to desaturate on magenta to see if I could fade it to gray, though I know it would be tricky to achieve that without affecting skin tone, too.</td>', 'Very nice portrait.  Only nit is that the bit of pink in the background keeps drawing my eye.  I might have tried to desaturate on magenta to see if I could fade it to gray, though I know it would be tricky to achieve that without affecting skin tone, too.', '2007-11-01 10:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
