(4212488, 606419, 47704, '<td valign="top">This could have been good.  Just a little piece of advice.  I would have shot it to one side.  Your subject is just in the middle of the pic.  Refer to the rule of 3rds.  Also, it looks a little OOF.  It''s just my opinion but I''d change it to a sepia tone instead of B&amp;W.</td>', 'This could have been good.  Just a little piece of advice.  I would have shot it to one side.  Your subject is just in the middle of the pic.  Refer to the rule of 3rds.  Also, it looks a little OOF.  It''s just my opinion but I''d change it to a sepia tone instead of B&W.', '2007-11-01 14:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
