(4213154, 606541, 66515, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here but the bricks on the left are too dark to really work within the shot. The bricks on the right however work for me. The main subject also seems a bit tilted.</td>', 'I like the idea here but the bricks on the left are too dark to really work within the shot. The bricks on the right however work for me. The main subject also seems a bit tilted.', '2007-11-01 18:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4213159, 606407, 66515, '<td valign="top">I like the light you captured here. Great sharpness and contrast as well.</td>', 'I like the light you captured here. Great sharpness and contrast as well.', '2007-11-01 18:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4213163, 605524, 66515, '<td valign="top">Great idea and great capture. I like the monotone look to the shot. The title is good too!</td>', 'Great idea and great capture. I like the monotone look to the shot. The title is good too!', '2007-11-01 18:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4213166, 605764, 66515, '<td valign="top">Good choice on the black and white conversion. The misty background is excellent and well handled in terms of exposure. I like the slight diagonal of the hill and the silhouette of the tree.</td>', 'Good choice on the black and white conversion. The misty background is excellent and well handled in terms of exposure. I like the slight diagonal of the hill and the silhouette of the tree.', '2007-11-01 18:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4213169, 605594, 66515, '<td valign="top">A little too subtle to appreciate without the title I''m afraid. The contrast looks a little muddy too.</td>', 'A little too subtle to appreciate without the title I''m afraid. The contrast looks a little muddy too.', '2007-11-01 18:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4213174, 605051, 66515, '<td valign="top">Nice use of "painting with light". The light falls off at the back of the bus but it works here. I would like to see more of the front of the bus as its cropped.</td>', 'Nice use of "painting with light". The light falls off at the back of the bus but it works here. I would like to see more of the front of the bus as its cropped.', '2007-11-01 18:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4213177, 605251, 66515, '<td valign="top">Subtle and highly effective. I like the shallow DOF used here. Lighting is excellent.</td>', 'Subtle and highly effective. I like the shallow DOF used here. Lighting is excellent.', '2007-11-01 18:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4213183, 606529, 66515, '<td valign="top">While not a sterotypical subject for this challenge I think it works. It definitely conveys a feeling of age with the subtle wrinkles in the leaf and missing parts of it.<br/> <br/>The veins radiating out from the stem create good leading lines throughout the shot. The stem looks a little oversharpened however I may be nit picky on that.</td>', 'While not a sterotypical subject for this challenge I think it works. It definitely conveys a feeling of age with the subtle wrinkles in the leaf and missing parts of it. The veins radiating out from the stem create good leading lines throughout the shot. The stem looks a little oversharpened however I may be nit picky on that.', '2007-11-01 18:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4213189, 606698, 66515, '<td valign="top">The person/thing in the back ground is distracting. Had the focus been on them instead of the headstone in the foreground I think it would work better. I like the leading lines and zig-zag pattern of the path leading to the background.</td>', 'The person/thing in the back ground is distracting. Had the focus been on them instead of the headstone in the foreground I think it would work better. I like the leading lines and zig-zag pattern of the path leading to the background.', '2007-11-01 18:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4213194, 604794, 66515, '<td valign="top">Good choice of subject and I like the sepia conversion. I like how you brought out the texture in the gloves. The composition is quite pleasing as well.</td>', 'Good choice of subject and I like the sepia conversion. I like how you brought out the texture in the gloves. The composition is quite pleasing as well.', '2007-11-01 18:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4213199, 606722, 66515, '<td valign="top">Very subtle and effective. The leaves give us that end of Baseball season and the marked up ball adds to this. Nice use of shallow DOF. The focus does fall of a bit on the back of the ball however I think that''s okay in this case.</td>', 'Very subtle and effective. The leaves give us that end of Baseball season and the marked up ball adds to this. Nice use of shallow DOF. The focus does fall of a bit on the back of the ball however I think that''s okay in this case.', '2007-11-01 18:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4213202, 606521, 66515, '<td valign="top">A little oversaturated and oversharpened. I would have considered reframing this shot so that the powerline overhead was out of the shot. I would have also tried to get the stacks straight as I think they are the strongest element to work with.<br/> <br/>There is also some bright spots on the stacks that are quite blown out. Underexposing this a bit would have brought out more texture which would create more interest.</td>', 'A little oversaturated and oversharpened. I would have considered reframing this shot so that the powerline overhead was out of the shot. I would have also tried to get the stacks straight as I think they are the strongest element to work with. There is also some bright spots on the stacks that are quite blown out. Underexposing this a bit would have brought out more texture which would create more interest.', '2007-11-01 18:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
