(4215039, 606811, 10665, '<td valign="top">ÉNice composition, the placement of the tree is great.  The bright area in the sky on the right draws my eye to it rather than the rest of the image.</td>', 'ÉNice composition, the placement of the tree is great.  The bright area in the sky on the right draws my eye to it rather than the rest of the image.', '2007-11-02 07:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
