(4215047, 606189, 10665, '<td valign="top">Great symetry in this shot.  My only negative is the brightness of the window at the end of the hall, but given that this is basic editing there wasn''t much you could do.</td>', 'Great symetry in this shot.  My only negative is the brightness of the window at the end of the hall, but given that this is basic editing there wasn''t much you could do.', '2007-11-02 07:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
