(4215076, 606254, 10665, '<td valign="top">I would have prefered if there had been more light around the eyes, they seem to hold so much it''s a shame tht they are hodden in the shadows.</td>', 'I would have prefered if there had been more light around the eyes, they seem to hold so much it''s a shame tht they are hodden in the shadows.', '2007-11-02 07:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
