(4216105, 606242, 66952, '<td valign="top">I get the idea, but I never even noticed the chair until I read the title.</td>', 'I get the idea, but I never even noticed the chair until I read the title.', '2007-11-02 15:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4216107, 606409, 66952, '<td valign="top">In interesting shot of an old church, but it need more contrast to really pop. Overall, the light parts are too dark.</td>', 'In interesting shot of an old church, but it need more contrast to really pop. Overall, the light parts are too dark.', '2007-11-02 15:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4216121, 605726, 66952, '<td valign="top">An interesting old wheel. Maybe too much saturation. This might work better as more of a high contrast graphic image, but the graphic nature of the image gets lost in all the colorful paint.</td>', 'An interesting old wheel. Maybe too much saturation. This might work better as more of a high contrast graphic image, but the graphic nature of the image gets lost in all the colorful paint.', '2007-11-02 15:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4216127, 606419, 66952, '<td valign="top">This might make a good print, but for the web it doesn''t have enough contrast. You might try using levels to bring out more of the dark stuff.</td>', 'This might make a good print, but for the web it doesn''t have enough contrast. You might try using levels to bring out more of the dark stuff.', '2007-11-02 15:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4216133, 604985, 66952, '<td valign="top">This is a good idea, but there isn''t enough in focus to tell what it is, except for a bit of chain.</td>', 'This is a good idea, but there isn''t enough in focus to tell what it is, except for a bit of chain.', '2007-11-02 15:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4216149, 606777, 66952, '<td valign="top">I like the pose and expression. The b&amp;w conversion is good, except you lost a lot of detail in his white beard. Since the beard is such a major part of the image, it''s really noticeable.</td>', 'I like the pose and expression. The b&w conversion is good, except you lost a lot of detail in his white beard. Since the beard is such a major part of the image, it''s really noticeable.', '2007-11-02 15:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4216157, 606815, 66952, '<td valign="top">Good idea. You might try recropping, to get less of the wall and more of the window. It seems a bit unbalanced the way it is.</td>', 'Good idea. You might try recropping, to get less of the wall and more of the window. It seems a bit unbalanced the way it is.', '2007-11-02 15:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4216167, 606747, 66952, '<td valign="top">A nice shot of the mill, but the color saturation is over the top, and takes away from the "old" feel.</td>', 'A nice shot of the mill, but the color saturation is over the top, and takes away from the "old" feel.', '2007-11-02 15:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4216185, 605612, 66952, '<td valign="top">I like the misty feel of the image a lot. Two things that might make it work a little better...the monument looks like it''s not standing up straight. It may actually not stand up straight in real life, but for someone who doesn''t know that, the tilt is a bit disconcerting. The second thing...did you try cropping a bit off the left to get the monument a bit off center? I''m thinking that might help give the composition some life. It''s pretty static with the monument plopped in the middle of the frame.</td>', 'I like the misty feel of the image a lot. Two things that might make it work a little better...the monument looks like it''s not standing up straight. It may actually not stand up straight in real life, but for someone who doesn''t know that, the tilt is a bit disconcerting. The second thing...did you try cropping a bit off the left to get the monument a bit off center? I''m thinking that might help give the composition some life. It''s pretty static with the monument plopped in the middle of the frame.', '2007-11-02 15:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4216194, 606821, 66952, '<td valign="top">The flowers are very bright, and take up more space in the scene than the temple, so I almost missed seeing the temple.</td>', 'The flowers are very bright, and take up more space in the scene than the temple, so I almost missed seeing the temple.', '2007-11-02 15:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
