(4226884, 605524, 14986, '<td valign="top">Very good idea and execution of the idea.  Good tones, focus and composition.  I think you chose correctly in making it vertical.  Congrats on a top 10 finish!</td>', 'Very good idea and execution of the idea.  Good tones, focus and composition.  I think you chose correctly in making it vertical.  Congrats on a top 10 finish!', '2007-11-07 00:13:08.000000', NULL, 0),
