(4226947, 606391, 20168, '<td valign="top">Congrats Thomas on this fabulous entry. The lighting and movement/stillness contrast is stunning. Though I''d loved to have seen this in the high 6''s rather than high 5''s, I''m moved by your photographic vision.</td>', 'Congrats Thomas on this fabulous entry. The lighting and movement/stillness contrast is stunning. Though I''d loved to have seen this in the high 6''s rather than high 5''s, I''m moved by your photographic vision.', '2007-11-07 00:22:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(4226955, 606757, 43088, '<td valign="top">WHeee! My first ribbon! And a Blue! Thanks everybody!  Strike one for the little guy- this was shot with just a point and shoot Fuji camera (which I had converted to shoot in infrared only which was a major contributor to the drama in this shot).   <br/> <br/>I love infrared right now- but not the false color ones you most often see so I set my camera to record images in black and white. This is an incredible score and I will have an extremely hard time bettering it. But to get better is certainly something to strive for. <br/> <br/>Color was nice, but not as interesting. A color out-take:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=609962" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/40000-44999/43088/120/609962.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/40000-44999/43088/120/609962.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/40000-44999/43088/120/609962.jpg"/></a></td>', 'WHeee! My first ribbon! And a Blue! Thanks everybody!  Strike one for the little guy- this was shot with just a point and shoot Fuji camera (which I had converted to shoot in infrared only which was a major contributor to the drama in this shot).    I love infrared right now- but not the false color ones you most often see so I set my camera to record images in black and white. This is an incredible score and I will have an extremely hard time bettering it. But to get better is certainly something to strive for.  Color was nice, but not as interesting. A color out-take:', '2007-11-07 00:24:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4226956, 606122, 70514, '<td valign="top">Is this that old Psych hospital?  Even if not, this is lovely, I love the area, and it is very nicely PP, imo.</td>', 'Is this that old Psych hospital?  Even if not, this is lovely, I love the area, and it is very nicely PP, imo.', '2007-11-07 00:24:53.000000', NULL, 0),
