(4227133, 606765, 50641, '<td valign="top">I''m not usually a fan of camera pictures, but that is one of the coolest I''ve seen.  Like what you did with the perspective.  Lighting looks pretty durn good too.  Way to whip it out!<br/> <br/>edit: my spelling was world weary<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-11-12 02:49:17.</i></td>', 'I''m not usually a fan of camera pictures, but that is one of the coolest I''ve seen.  Like what you did with the perspective.  Lighting looks pretty durn good too.  Way to whip it out! edit: my spelling was world weary', '2007-11-07 01:16:29.000000', '2007-11-12 02:49:17.000000', 0),
