(4227798, 606203, 56002, '<td valign="top">I didn''t actually intend this shot for the challenge (oddly enough).  And the neg comments were right on...<br/>1.  Needs more contrast and color (yup, too true).  (poor edit)<br/>2.  Not a good rep of 1946 (yes again.  In fact, the items are era mixed and do not collectively represent any period very well.<br/>3.  It looks too staged.  Agreed.<br/> <br/>All that said, we had fun shooting it and she is just too too cute (this is my wife once again).</td>', 'I didn''t actually intend this shot for the challenge (oddly enough).  And the neg comments were right on...1.  Needs more contrast and color (yup, too true).  (poor edit)2.  Not a good rep of 1946 (yes again.  In fact, the items are era mixed and do not collectively represent any period very well.3.  It looks too staged.  Agreed. All that said, we had fun shooting it and she is just too too cute (this is my wife once again).', '2007-11-07 08:47:11.000000', NULL, 0),
