(4236630, 606154, 68035, '<td valign="top">Not for the wonderful portrait<br/>Not for the textures of the skin<br/>Not for the blueness of the eyes<br/>Not for the outstanding colouring elsewhere in the image<br/>Not for the great way you have filled the frame<br/>Not for the composition<br/>Not for the pin point sharpness<br/>Not for the DOF<br/> <br/>All of these are fantastic<br/> <br/>But it is for the story behind the shot that I will always admire and respect you and feel honoured to have you as a friend on DPC</td>', 'Not for the wonderful portraitNot for the textures of the skinNot for the blueness of the eyesNot for the outstanding colouring elsewhere in the imageNot for the great way you have filled the frameNot for the compositionNot for the pin point sharpnessNot for the DOF All of these are fantastic But it is for the story behind the shot that I will always admire and respect you and feel honoured to have you as a friend on DPC', '2007-11-10 08:34:54.000000', NULL, 0),
