(4237015, 606747, 80096, '<td valign="top">Jason,<br/> <br/>You are one of the few photographers who has the courage to create beautiful digital paintings from your images. I would love to see more of these digital works of art in DPC. As a graphic illustrator/fine artist, I truly appreciate these kinds of creative interpretations. Beauty is in definitely in the eye of the beholder.<br/> <br/>Keep up the good work!</td>', 'Jason, You are one of the few photographers who has the courage to create beautiful digital paintings from your images. I would love to see more of these digital works of art in DPC. As a graphic illustrator/fine artist, I truly appreciate these kinds of creative interpretations. Beauty is in definitely in the eye of the beholder. Keep up the good work!', '2007-11-10 12:36:06.000000', NULL, 0),
